title: Republican Coordination
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: in_republican_socialist and weimar_rally_timer <= 0 and izq_rep_relation >= 50 and radical_relation >= 40
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; weimar_rally_timer += 6
card-image: img/placeholder.jpg
tags: party_affairs

= Republican Coordination

Thanks to our strong ties with the <span style="color: #7B2D8E;">**Republican Left**</span> and the <span style="color: #E8B23A;">Radical Party</span>, they have once again rallied to defend the Republic we helped establish together. A cross-party republican-defense committee, once a loose alliance of figures from all three parties, has now been restructured into an active political organization - intended to complement the efforts of the militia.

Membership has surged, and fresh funding has arrived from all three coalition parties. The question now is: what will we do with control of this new organization?

- @nazi: Focus attacks on the <span style="color: #0087DC;">CEDA</span>/<span style="color: #14322a;">Falange</span> right - currently the greatest threat to the Republic.
- @rally: Conduct joint rallies and deepen electoral cooperation between the parties.
- @republic: Launch a mass propaganda campaign in support of the republic and in opposition to <span style="color: #808080;">dictatorship</span>.
- @relation: Strengthen ties with the republican coalition parties.
- @easy_discard

@nazi
on-arrival: industrial_falange -= 2; urban_middle_falange -= 2; smallholder_falange -= 2; catholic_falange -= 2

The committee's main effort is to steer people away from the <span style="color: #0087DC;">CEDA</span>/<span style="color: #14322a;">Falange</span> and expose the contradictions and demagoguery inherent in their politics.

@rally
on-arrival: industrial_psoe += (pro_republic / 15); urban_middle_psoe += (pro_republic / 15); smallholder_psoe += (pro_republic / 20); landless_psoe += (pro_republic / 20); industrial_izq_rep += (pro_republic / 40); urban_middle_izq_rep += (pro_republic / 20); smallholder_izq_rep += (pro_republic / 20); landless_izq_rep += (pro_republic / 30); industrial_radical += (pro_republic / 30); urban_middle_radical += (pro_republic / 15); smallholder_radical += (pro_republic / 15); landless_radical += (pro_republic / 25); peoples_party_support += 1; neorevisionist_strength += 5; left_dissent += 3; pce_relation -= 5

We rally alongside politicians from the <span style="color: #7B2D8E;">**Republican Left**</span> and the <span style="color: #E8B23A;">Radicals</span>, united in our commitment to the Republic.

@republic
on-arrival: pro_republic += 6

The <span style="color: #14322a;">Falange</span> and <span style="color: #700000;">Communist</span> propaganda machines have poisoned some of the public's view of the Republic. Our goal is to counter their narrative with propaganda of our own.

@relation
on-arrival: izq_rep_relation += 5*(1-dissent); radical_relation += 5*(1-dissent)

We've been able to strengthen our relations with the involved parties through the participation of moderate figures from both the <span style="color: #7B2D8E;">**Republican Left**</span> and the <span style="color: #E8B23A;">Radical Party</span>.
